{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Frequently Asked Questions"}], "prev": {"link": "../how-to-avoid-flood-waits/", "title": "How to avoid Flood Waits?"}, "next": {"link": "../../releases/", "title": "Release Notes"}, "title": "The account has been limited/deactivated", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"the-account-has-been-limited-deactivated\">\n<h1>The account has been limited/deactivated<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#the-account-has-been-limited-deactivated\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Pyrogram is a framework that interfaces with Telegram; it is at your commands, meaning it only does what you tell it to\ndo, the rest is up to you and Telegram (see <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://telegram.org/tos\">Telegram\u2019s ToS</a>).</p>\n<p>If you found your account being limited/deactivated, it could be due spam/flood/abuse of the API or the usage of certain\nvirtual/VoIP numbers.</p>\n<p>If you think your account was limited/deactivated by mistake, you can write to <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"mailto:recover&#37;&#52;&#48;telegram&#46;org\">recover<span>&#64;</span>telegram<span>&#46;</span>org</a>, contact\n<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://t.me/spambot\">&#64;SpamBot</a> or use <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://telegram.org/support\">this form</a>.</p>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["releases/index", "Release Notes", "N", "next"], ["faq/how-to-avoid-flood-waits", "How to avoid Flood Waits?", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">The account has been limited/deactivated</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "faq/the-account-has-been-limited-deactivated", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}